From de742e19e170109262fd79929e3be9e039daa650 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: danste22 <daniel@steinhauf.eu>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 10:27:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: SPL SPI: NAND boot and T113/R528 support

Add SPI NAND read, 2-byte address commands, multiple boot attempts, and
the Allwinner R528/T113 SPI controller so Turing Pi 2 BMC can cold-boot
from SPI NAND with a legacy uImage at 0x8000.

Signed-off-by: danste22 <daniel@steinhauf.eu>
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 arch/arm/include/asm/arch-sunxi/spl.h |   9 +-
 arch/arm/mach-sunxi/Kconfig           |  28 ++-
 arch/arm/mach-sunxi/board.c           |  62 +++++-
 arch/arm/mach-sunxi/spl_spi_sunxi.c   | 259 +++++++++++++++++++-------
 4 files changed, 282 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)

